  "content": "<center>\n\n![Potion_Recipes_Vanilla_Edition_Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/502f361e0d01e18f0fbf690e12b21506d1fb7970_0.webp)\n\n  \n**¡Hola! ~ 欢迎来到药水配方：原版版！**\n\n有了这个资源包，你在制作自己的药水时会得到一些额外的帮助，让过程变得更加简单，并在任何时间、任何地点酿造任何药水时节省大量时间。\n\n所有你需要的帮助，都在酿造台界面中！\n\n<br>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/b46eb6k-TWw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a> <a href=\"https://x.com/SPixelForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"> </a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"NO DEPENDENCIES REQUIRED\" width=\"660\" height=\"35\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n**此资源包与原版 Minecraft 完美兼容——无需额外模组。** \n\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/16b6589f1f80535554e90efd303b5eb53deccc80.png\" alt=\"Embrace the dark side\" width=\"550\" height=\"35\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/potion-recipes-dark-mode-edition!\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0593dc091108c8dd613ae3b553c4ff977094f5a_0.webp\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Dark Mode\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\"> </a>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"MORE INTERESTING PROJECTS\" width=\"690\" height=\"35\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"20\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/shadows-pixels-reforged\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c5b3f05c13dac83081221b58110365ada040c7_0.webp\" alt=\"Pixels Reforged Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      Shadow's<br> Pixels Reforged!\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/the-night-of-the-living-pumpkins\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"TNotLP Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      The Night of the <br> Living Pumpkins! <br>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/potion-recipes-pixels-reforged-edition!\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/543bdae3a809c8f18421b8c685cb5acf2ee52502.png\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Pixels Reforged Edition Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      Potion Recipes: <br> Pixels Reforged Edition\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"YOUR SUPPORT MAKES THE DIFFERENCE\" width=\"850\" height=\"35\">\n<br>\n<br>\n如果你喜欢我创作的内容，不妨加入我的 Patreon 或 Ko-fi，享受所有仅限会员的独家内容。你将获得大量附加内容，如开发中的作品（WIP）、制作花絮、开发博客等等！\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge/tiers\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"join ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"80\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"join patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"80\"> </a> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"FAQs\" width=\"155\" height=\"35\">\n\n</center>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n这里有一些你可能有的常见问题的解答，希望能对你有所帮助。\n\n<details>\n  <summary>常见问题解答</summary>\n\n> **问：药水配方：原版版是模组/整合包/数据包/插件吗？**\n> \n> 答：不，这只是一个资源包！\n\n> **问：你能/会制作基岩版移植版本吗？**\n> \n> 答：要制作能在基岩版上运行的版本，我需要学习基岩版的运作机制。所以目前我不打算很快做这件事，但它最终会出现。\n\n> **问：你会/会制作模组吗？**\n> \n> 答：目前我只在做资源包，但我不排除在不久的将来开发与药水配方相关的新内容。\n\n> **问：我可以把你的资源包放进我的整合包里吗？**\n> \n> 答：可以，只要注明出处即可。\n\n\n</details>",
